cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the original paper."
title: "pi-cwl — Context Window Lifecycle for Pi"
abstract: >-
  An original, independent TypeScript implementation of Structured Context
  Eviction (CWL) for the Pi agent ecosystem, implementing the technique
  described in "Beyond Compaction: Structured Context Eviction for
  Long-Horizon Agents" (arXiv:2606.11213). Deterministic, LLM-free graduated
  eviction over a graph of agent-typed episodes. No third-party source code
  was copied, forked, or adapted.
